## Overview

Rockstar's customer support page, last updated November 4, 2026, says the game can be reserved for PlayStation 5 and for Xbox's Series X and Series S consoles.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Take-Two's pre-order announcement gives the launch date as November 19, 2026 and discusses digital pre-load timing for reservations.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} Official platform lists on Rockstar's support page and website do not include a personal-computer release.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}{{cite:gamespot-pc-status}}

## Physical and edition details

Rockstar lists Standard and Ultimate editions, and says Standard owners may buy an Ultimate Edition Upgrade as a separate digital add-on.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} The boxed retail package holds a download code rather than an optical disc, and physical copies are expected to ship or be available for pickup beginning November 12, 2026 to help with pre-loading.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} The Standard boxed code also redeems the Vintage Vice City Pack and other listed reservation bonuses.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## PC status

GameSpot reports that Rockstar has not officially announced a PC edition, and that current platform information names only the PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series consoles.{{cite:gamespot-pc-status}} This wiki therefore does not treat a PC release as confirmed.{{cite:gamespot-pc-status}}{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

