## Overview

Grand Theft Auto VI is offered in two editions: Standard and Ultimate.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Standard Edition

The Standard Edition provides the base game.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} The listed U.S. price for the Standard Edition is $79.99.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Ultimate Edition

The Ultimate Edition bundles the game together with the Ultimate Edition Upgrade.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} The Ultimate Edition is marketed with a package of additional premium vehicles, weapons, apparel, and other items tied into Jason and Lucia’s storyline.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} The listed U.S. price for the Ultimate Edition is $99.99.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Ultimate Edition Upgrade

Owners of the Standard Edition can buy the Ultimate Edition Upgrade separately at any time.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Buyers of the physical Standard Edition may purchase the Upgrade after redeeming the included digital download code.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

