## When reservations opened

Take-Two announced that reservations for the game would open at local midnight on June 25, 2026.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Where to reserve a copy

The same announcement said copies could be reserved through the PlayStation Store, the Microsoft Store, the Rockstar Games Store, and retailers worldwide.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} Rockstar's support page adds that both digital and physical versions were offered.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Bonuses and timing

Take-Two said every reservation or purchase completed before November 20, 2026 included the Vintage Vice City Pack, and that digital reservations also received a complimentary month of GTA+.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} PlayStation Store legal text states that this complimentary month must be claimed by March 31, 2027.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} Microsoft's store listing required a purchase before 23:59:59 on November 19, 2026 to receive the Vintage Vice City Pack and the one-month GTA+ offer.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Physical copies and pre-load

Physical boxes ship with a download code that also covers the Vintage Vice City Pack.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Rockstar's support documentation says digital reservations can begin pre-loading on November 10, 2026 at midnight local time on PlayStation and at 12 a.m. GMT on Xbox.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Take-Two's earlier press release instead named November 12, 2026 as the start of digital pre-loading.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

