## Overview

Rockstar's biography says Lucia learned to fight young and served time in the Leonida Penitentiary after fighting for her family.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} The official profile adds that hardship has followed her ever since, and that a stroke of luck is what got her out of prison.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## After her release

The same biography says she is newly free and determined to shift the odds in her favor, having decided that only careful choices come next.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Ambition

Rockstar's account states that Lucia wants the comfortable life her mother has imagined since the family lived in Liberty City, and that she intends to handle the situation herself rather than rely on unfinished schemes.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} The profile also stresses her view that connections and resources are what count.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Connection to Jason Duval

Official material indicates Lucia sees a relationship with Jason as a possible escape.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Jason's profile says their meeting might turn out very well or very badly for him.{{cite:gta6-people-jason}}

