## Overview

Rockstar hosts official Grand Theft Auto VI videos and downloads on the game’s media pages.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} The official site presents distinct entries labeled WATCH for Trailer 1, Trailer 2, An Extended Look, and the Launch Trailer.{{cite:gta6-official-site}}

## Trailer 1

Rockstar published Grand Theft Auto VI Trailer 1 on December 4, 2023.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}} Trailer 1 is listed with a runtime of 1:31 on Rockstar’s pre-load page.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}}

## Trailer 2

Rockstar published Grand Theft Auto VI Trailer 2 on May 6, 2025.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}} Trailer 2 is listed with a runtime of 2:47 on Rockstar’s pre-load page.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}}

## An Extended Look

Grand Theft Auto VI: An Extended Look was released on August 27, 2026.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}} The Extended Look runs 26 minutes and 48 seconds as listed on Rockstar’s pre-load page.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}} Netflix debuted Grand Theft Auto VI: An Extended Look to Netflix members on August 27, 2026.{{cite:netflix-extended-look}} Netflix states the Extended Look was captured entirely from in-game PlayStation 5 footage.{{cite:netflix-extended-look}}

## Launch Trailer and Pre-load video

Rockstar published the Grand Theft Auto VI Launch Trailer on October 15, 2026.{{cite:gta6-launch-trailer-page}} Rockstar’s Launch Trailer page credits the debut of an original score track “Flower in a Hurricane.”{{cite:gta6-launch-trailer-page}} Rockstar posted a Pre-Load Now news entry on November 10, 2026 announcing Grand Theft Auto VI pre-loading availability.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}}

