## Overview

The Ultimate Edition packages Grand Theft Auto VI together with the GTAVI: Ultimate Edition Upgrade, offering additional in-game items and bonuses alongside the base game.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Rockstar states that these bonuses are "threaded across all aspects of Jason and Lucia's story."{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Contents

Rockstar's published contents for the Ultimate Edition list the '95 Grotti Cheetah as an included vehicle.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

The Hawk and Little Morgan Revolvers are enumerated among the Edition's included weapons.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Personalized Weapon Variants are named as part of the Ultimate Edition package.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Vice City Styles are listed in the official contents.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Jason's Safehouse Vehicles are specified as included Ultimate Edition items.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

The Ganado Retro Build appears on Rockstar's list of bundled content.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Rideout Customs Mod Shop is included in the official Ultimate Edition contents.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Sara's Unisex Salon is also named in Rockstar's Ultimate Edition listing.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

The Shitzu Squalo is included among the Edition's items.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Rockstar lists the Stock 305 Clothing Store as part of the Ultimate Edition.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

A '67 Vapid Dominator Buggy and an accompanying garage are included in the official contents.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

The Electric Fang Tattoo Parlor is named on the Ultimate Edition contents list.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

One-Eyed Willie's Mod Shop is listed among the bundled Ultimate Edition features.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Goodtime Gear is included in Rockstar's published contents for the Ultimate Edition.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

The PTT Youngin$ Compound is part of the Ultimate Edition contents as listed by Rockstar.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Rockstar's official list also specifies a Classic Car Collection as included in the Ultimate Edition.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Upgrade and availability

Owners of the Standard Edition may buy the Ultimate Edition Upgrade as a separate digital add-on at any time.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Rockstar's support pages explain that purchasers of the physical Standard Edition receive a download code and can upgrade after redeeming that code, and that a standalone physical Ultimate Edition will not be offered.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Price and store listings

Take-Two's announcement lists the Ultimate Edition price as $99.99.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

The PlayStation Store listing for the PS5 edition shows the Ultimate Edition priced at $99.99.{{cite:playstation-gta6}}

