## Overview

The Vintage Vice City Pack is a pre-order bonus offering items tied to Jason and Lucia’s story.{{cite:gta6-official-site}}

## Contents

The pack includes the 55 Vapid Stanier sedan and a garage.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

An exclusive weapon pattern is part of the Vintage Vice City Pack.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

A one-month GTA+ membership is included for digital pre-orders.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## How to obtain and timing

Digital pre-orders and purchases before November 20, 2026 include the Vintage Vice City Pack and one month GTA+.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Digital pre-loading begins November 10 at midnight local time (PlayStation) or 12 a.m. GMT (Xbox).{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

The physical version contains a download code for the game and the Vintage Vice City Pack, with shipping starting November 12.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

Physical Standard Edition owners can upgrade to Ultimate Edition later via digital stores; physical Ultimate Edition is not available.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

On PlayStation, pre-orders or purchases by November 19 include Vintage Vice City Pack and one month of GTA+, claimable by March 31, 2027.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}}

On Xbox, pre-orders prior to November 19, 23:59:59, include Vintage Vice City Pack and one month of GTA+.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

