## Offer

Digital pre-orders and purchases of Grand Theft Auto VI made before November 20, 2026 include one month of GTA+.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Redemption deadlines and platform notes

On PlayStation, the one-month GTA+ can be claimed any time before March 31, 2027.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}}

On Xbox, the complimentary GTA+ month must be redeemed within 180 days of placing the pre-order.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}} Redemption on Xbox is not available to child accounts that are restricted from age-restricted content.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}} The Microsoft Store limits the pre-order GTA+ redemption to one redemption per Platform Account.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Auto-renewal and continuation

Sony states the one-month GTA+ subscription auto-renews and will continue on a monthly basis until cancelled.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} PlayStation also notes the subscription is non-transferable and restricted to one redemption per account.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}}

## GTA+ and the Games Library

Take-Two calls the free month of GTA+ "the best way to get the most out of" GTA Online.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} The company further says the complimentary month is redeemable immediately so players can access Grand Theft Auto V and other older Rockstar titles through the GTA+ Games Library.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

