## Availability

Microsoft said Grand Theft Auto VI would be streamable at launch through Xbox Cloud Gaming, including on Xbox One hardware and on Series X and Series S consoles, beginning at 1 a.m. ET on November 19, 2026.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}} Starting November 11, customers in supported regions can buy cloud playtime to stream eligible titles without a Game Pass subscription.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Technical notes

According to Xbox, cloud streams of the game use Series S graphics settings.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Purchase and account

Xbox's announcement notes that cloud play requires a separate purchase of the game.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Related platform note

GameSpot quotes Xbox as clarifying that the game "will not be streaming exclusively or to PC."{{cite:gamespot-pc-status}}

